{title: Indescribable (FJ_63_en)}
{subtitle: Von den Gipfeln der Welt}
{song_number: 63}
{key: E}
{tempo: 180}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C#m7]From the highest of heights to the [B/D#]depths of the [E]sea,
[F#m7]creation's revealing Your [E]majesty. [D]
[C#m7]From the colors of fall to the [B/D#]fragrance of [E]spring,
[F#m7]ev'ry creature unique in the [E]song that it [D]sings.
[A/C#]All exclaiming: [B/D#]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E]Indescribable, [B]uncontainable,
[A]You placed the stars in the sky and You know them by [C#m7]name.
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
[E]All powerful, [B]untamable,
[A]awestruck, we fall to our knees as we humbly pro[C#m7]claim:
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
[E]Incomparable, [B]unchangeable,
[A]You see the depths of my heart and You love me the [C#m7]same.
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C#m7]Who has told ev'ry lightning bolt [B/D#]where it should [E]go
[F#m7]or seen heavenly storehouses [E]laden with [D]snow?
[C#m7]Who imagined the sun and gives [B/D#]source to its [E]light,
[F#m7]yet conceals it to bring us the [E]coolness of [D]night?
[A/C#]None can fathom. [B/D#]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[E]Indescribable, [B]uncontainable,
[A]You placed the stars in the sky and You know them by [C#m7]name.
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
[E]All powerful, [B]untamable,
[A]awestruck, we fall to our knees as we humbly pro[C#m7]claim:
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
[E]Incomparable, [B]unchangeable,
[A]You see the depths of my heart and You love me the [C#m7]same.
[E/G#]You are amazing, [A]God.
{end_of_chorus}
